  "note": "八卦迷阵 (eight0-7.c, closed.c): eight illusions, each under a sky, a ground and a weather of its own after its text, all held in the same thin mist (神密的薄雾) that blurs the distance; the 路牌 in each names its 卦. 坤 green plain, 艮 mountains round, 坎 water and a little land, 巽 a freezing wind, 震 lead cloud and lightning, 离 fire, 兑 a great lake, 乾 clear sky over rich fields; 绝地 dead rock in thick fog. (美术规划 G 组: 幻境.)",
